§§ `s 275(e) abandonment`

#ASSERT (`s 275(e) the board or governing body may abandon the proposed dissolution without further action by the stockholders or members` WITH `the resolution authorizing the proposed dissolution provides that the board of directors or governing body may abandon it without further action by the stockholders or members` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The resolution is silent: the subsection says nothing, so not covered.
#ASSERT (`s 275(e) the board or governing body may abandon the proposed dissolution without further action by the stockholders or members` WITH `the resolution authorizing the proposed dissolution provides that the board of directors or governing body may abandon it without further action by the stockholders or members` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 275(f) a corporation with a limited duration`

-- 90 calendar days.
#ASSERT (`s 275(f) the longest time before the specified date within which the certificate of dissolution is filed`)'s `how many units` EQUALS 90
#ASSERT (`s 275(f) the longest time before the specified date within which the certificate of dissolution is filed`)'s unit EQUALS `calendar days`
-- Specified date 30 June 2027. Filing on 1 April 2027 is exactly 90 days before: in time.
#ASSERT `s 275(f) the certificate of dissolution is filed within 90 days before the specified date` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 30, `the date the certificate of dissolution is filed` IS YearMonthDay 2027 4 1
-- 31 March 2027 is 91 days before: too early.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(f) the certificate of dissolution is filed within 90 days before the specified date` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 30, `the date the certificate of dissolution is filed` IS YearMonthDay 2027 3 31)
-- 29 June 2027 is 1 day before: in time.
#ASSERT `s 275(f) the certificate of dissolution is filed within 90 days before the specified date` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 30, `the date the certificate of dissolution is filed` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 29
-- 30 June 2027 is the specified date itself, not "before" it (fork F4); 1 July 2027 is after it.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(f) the certificate of dissolution is filed within 90 days before the specified date` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 30, `the date the certificate of dissolution is filed` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 30)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(f) the certificate of dissolution is filed within 90 days before the specified date` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 30, `the date the certificate of dissolution is filed` IS YearMonthDay 2027 7 1)
--  columns of the certificate on expiry: name, the specified date, directors and officers, date of original certificate, the agreement under (i)
#ASSERT `s 275(f) the certificate of dissolution on expiry states what the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 275(f) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(f) the certificate of dissolution on expiry states what the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 275(f) certificate` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(f) the certificate of dissolution on expiry states what the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 275(f) certificate` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(f) the certificate of dissolution on expiry states what the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 275(f) certificate` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(f) the certificate of dissolution on expiry states what the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 275(f) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(f) the certificate of dissolution on expiry states what the subsection requires` WITH `the certificate` IS (`t 275(f) certificate` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
-- Existence expires on the specified date whether or not a certificate was filed: the rule has no filing input.
#ASSERT `s 275(f) the corporation's existence has expired on the specified date` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 30, `the date of the question` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 30
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(f) the corporation's existence has expired on the specified date` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 30, `the date of the question` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 29)
-- The requirement to file remains where none was filed.
#ASSERT `s 275(f) the requirement to file a certificate of dissolution remains` WITH `no certificate of dissolution has been filed` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(f) the requirement to file a certificate of dissolution remains` WITH `no certificate of dissolution has been filed` IS FALSE)
-- A certificate of good standing issued after the specified date has no force or effect; one issued on or before it: not covered.
#ASSERT (`s 275(f) a certificate of good standing issued by the Secretary of State has force or effect` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 30, `the date the certificate of good standing was issued` IS YearMonthDay 2027 7 1) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 275(f) a certificate of good standing issued by the Secretary of State has force or effect` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 30, `the date the certificate of good standing was issued` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 30) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 275(f) a certificate of good standing issued by the Secretary of State has force or effect` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 30, `the date the certificate of good standing was issued` IS YearMonthDay 2026 1 1) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 275(g) when the corporation is dissolved`

-- The earlier of the specified date and the effectiveness of a certificate of dissolution.
#ASSERT (`s 275(g) the date on which the corporation is dissolved` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence, if there is one` IS JUST (YearMonthDay 2027 6 30), `the date a certificate of dissolution becomes effective in accordance with § 103, if one does` IS JUST (YearMonthDay 2027 5 1)) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2027 5 1)
#ASSERT (`s 275(g) the date on which the corporation is dissolved` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence, if there is one` IS JUST (YearMonthDay 2027 6 30), `the date a certificate of dissolution becomes effective in accordance with § 103, if one does` IS JUST (YearMonthDay 2027 8 1)) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2027 6 30)
#ASSERT (`s 275(g) the date on which the corporation is dissolved` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence, if there is one` IS JUST (YearMonthDay 2027 6 30), `the date a certificate of dissolution becomes effective in accordance with § 103, if one does` IS JUST (YearMonthDay 2027 6 30)) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2027 6 30)
#ASSERT (`s 275(g) the date on which the corporation is dissolved` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence, if there is one` IS JUST (YearMonthDay 2027 6 30), `the date a certificate of dissolution becomes effective in accordance with § 103, if one does` IS NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2027 6 30)
#ASSERT (`s 275(g) the date on which the corporation is dissolved` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence, if there is one` IS NOTHING, `the date a certificate of dissolution becomes effective in accordance with § 103, if one does` IS JUST (YearMonthDay 2027 5 1)) EQUALS JUST (YearMonthDay 2027 5 1)
-- Neither: the subsection dissolves nothing, so not covered.
#ASSERT (`s 275(g) the date on which the corporation is dissolved` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence, if there is one` IS NOTHING, `the date a certificate of dissolution becomes effective in accordance with § 103, if one does` IS NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 275(h) the registered agent`

-- Before the filing is effective the agent's authority stands.
#ASSERT `s 275(h) the registered agent's authority and responsibilities continue with respect to the process` WITH `the filing of the certificate of dissolution is effective` IS FALSE, `the registered agent received the process before the filing became effective` IS FALSE
-- After effectiveness it has ended, except for process the agent received before.
#ASSERT `s 275(h) the registered agent's authority and responsibilities continue with respect to the process` WITH `the filing of the certificate of dissolution is effective` IS TRUE, `the registered agent received the process before the filing became effective` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(h) the registered agent's authority and responsibilities continue with respect to the process` WITH `the filing of the certificate of dissolution is effective` IS TRUE, `the registered agent received the process before the filing became effective` IS FALSE)

§§ `s 275(i) service of process on the Secretary of State`

#ASSERT `s 275(i) the dissolving corporation has made the agreement and appointment the subsection requires` WITH `the corporation agrees that it may be served with process in this State in any proceeding for enforcement of any obligation of the dissolved corporation` IS TRUE, `the corporation irrevocably appoints the Secretary of State as its agent to accept service of process, effective on and after the effectiveness of the filing` IS TRUE, `the corporation specifies the address to which a copy of the process is to be sent` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the dissolving corporation has made the agreement and appointment the subsection requires` WITH `the corporation agrees that it may be served with process in this State in any proceeding for enforcement of any obligation of the dissolved corporation` IS FALSE, `the corporation irrevocably appoints the Secretary of State as its agent to accept service of process, effective on and after the effectiveness of the filing` IS TRUE, `the corporation specifies the address to which a copy of the process is to be sent` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the dissolving corporation has made the agreement and appointment the subsection requires` WITH `the corporation agrees that it may be served with process in this State in any proceeding for enforcement of any obligation of the dissolved corporation` IS TRUE, `the corporation irrevocably appoints the Secretary of State as its agent to accept service of process, effective on and after the effectiveness of the filing` IS FALSE, `the corporation specifies the address to which a copy of the process is to be sent` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the dissolving corporation has made the agreement and appointment the subsection requires` WITH `the corporation agrees that it may be served with process in this State in any proceeding for enforcement of any obligation of the dissolved corporation` IS TRUE, `the corporation irrevocably appoints the Secretary of State as its agent to accept service of process, effective on and after the effectiveness of the filing` IS TRUE, `the corporation specifies the address to which a copy of the process is to be sent` IS FALSE)
-- Electronic transmission only as prescribed by the Secretary of State.
#ASSERT `s 275(i) the service of process on the Secretary of State is by a permitted means` WITH `the process is served by electronic transmission` IS FALSE, `the electronic transmission is as prescribed by the Secretary of State` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 275(i) the service of process on the Secretary of State is by a permitted means` WITH `the process is served by electronic transmission` IS TRUE, `the electronic transmission is as prescribed by the Secretary of State` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the service of process on the Secretary of State is by a permitted means` WITH `the process is served by electronic transmission` IS TRUE, `the electronic transmission is as prescribed by the Secretary of State` IS FALSE)
-- The letter goes to the specified address, or to the last address designated in writing.
#ASSERT (`s 275(i) the address to which the Secretary of State sends the letter` WITH `the address the corporation specified for the copy of the process` IS "1 Main Street", `the addresses the dissolved corporation later designated in writing to the Secretary of State, in the order designated` IS EMPTY) EQUALS "1 Main Street"
#ASSERT (`s 275(i) the address to which the Secretary of State sends the letter` WITH `the address the corporation specified for the copy of the process` IS "1 Main Street", `the addresses the dissolved corporation later designated in writing to the Secretary of State, in the order designated` IS LIST "2 Oak Avenue", "3 Elm Road") EQUALS "3 Elm Road"
#ASSERT (`s 275(i) the address to which the Secretary of State sends the letter` WITH `the address the corporation specified for the copy of the process` IS "1 Main Street", `the addresses the dissolved corporation later designated in writing to the Secretary of State, in the order designated` IS LIST "2 Oak Avenue") EQUALS "2 Oak Avenue"
-- The letter: mail or courier, a record of mailing, a record of delivery signed for, the process enclosed.
#ASSERT `s 275(i) the letter from the Secretary of State is sent as the subsection requires` WITH `the letter is sent by a mail or courier service` IS TRUE, `the service includes a record of mailing or deposit with the courier` IS TRUE, `the service includes a record of delivery evidenced by the signature of the recipient` IS TRUE, `the letter encloses a copy of the process and any other papers served on the Secretary of State` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the letter from the Secretary of State is sent as the subsection requires` WITH `the letter is sent by a mail or courier service` IS FALSE, `the service includes a record of mailing or deposit with the courier` IS TRUE, `the service includes a record of delivery evidenced by the signature of the recipient` IS TRUE, `the letter encloses a copy of the process and any other papers served on the Secretary of State` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the letter from the Secretary of State is sent as the subsection requires` WITH `the letter is sent by a mail or courier service` IS TRUE, `the service includes a record of mailing or deposit with the courier` IS FALSE, `the service includes a record of delivery evidenced by the signature of the recipient` IS TRUE, `the letter encloses a copy of the process and any other papers served on the Secretary of State` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the letter from the Secretary of State is sent as the subsection requires` WITH `the letter is sent by a mail or courier service` IS TRUE, `the service includes a record of mailing or deposit with the courier` IS TRUE, `the service includes a record of delivery evidenced by the signature of the recipient` IS FALSE, `the letter encloses a copy of the process and any other papers served on the Secretary of State` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the letter from the Secretary of State is sent as the subsection requires` WITH `the letter is sent by a mail or courier service` IS TRUE, `the service includes a record of mailing or deposit with the courier` IS TRUE, `the service includes a record of delivery evidenced by the signature of the recipient` IS TRUE, `the letter encloses a copy of the process and any other papers served on the Secretary of State` IS FALSE)
-- The plaintiff's duty: duplicate, notice, fee.
#ASSERT `s 275(i) the plaintiff has done what the subsection makes the plaintiff's duty` WITH `the plaintiff served the process and any other papers in duplicate` IS TRUE, `the plaintiff notified the Secretary of State that service is being effected pursuant to section 275(i)` IS TRUE, `the plaintiff paid the Secretary of State the fee prescribed under § 391(a)(29)` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the plaintiff has done what the subsection makes the plaintiff's duty` WITH `the plaintiff served the process and any other papers in duplicate` IS FALSE, `the plaintiff notified the Secretary of State that service is being effected pursuant to section 275(i)` IS TRUE, `the plaintiff paid the Secretary of State the fee prescribed under § 391(a)(29)` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the plaintiff has done what the subsection makes the plaintiff's duty` WITH `the plaintiff served the process and any other papers in duplicate` IS TRUE, `the plaintiff notified the Secretary of State that service is being effected pursuant to section 275(i)` IS FALSE, `the plaintiff paid the Secretary of State the fee prescribed under § 391(a)(29)` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the plaintiff has done what the subsection makes the plaintiff's duty` WITH `the plaintiff served the process and any other papers in duplicate` IS TRUE, `the plaintiff notified the Secretary of State that service is being effected pursuant to section 275(i)` IS TRUE, `the plaintiff paid the Secretary of State the fee prescribed under § 391(a)(29)` IS FALSE)
-- The fee is taxed as part of the costs if the plaintiff prevails; otherwise the sentence says nothing.
#ASSERT (`s 275(i) the fee is taxed as part of the costs in the proceeding` WITH `the plaintiff prevails in the proceeding` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 275(i) the fee is taxed as part of the costs in the proceeding` WITH `the plaintiff prevails in the proceeding` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- The Secretary of State's alphabetical record: eight entries.
--  columns: plaintiff, defendant, title, docket number, nature, fact of service, return date, day and hour
#ASSERT `s 275(i) the Secretary of State's record of a service sets forth what the subsection requires` WITH `the record` IS (`t 275(i) record` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the Secretary of State's record of a service sets forth what the subsection requires` WITH `the record` IS (`t 275(i) record` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the Secretary of State's record of a service sets forth what the subsection requires` WITH `the record` IS (`t 275(i) record` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the Secretary of State's record of a service sets forth what the subsection requires` WITH `the record` IS (`t 275(i) record` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the Secretary of State's record of a service sets forth what the subsection requires` WITH `the record` IS (`t 275(i) record` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the Secretary of State's record of a service sets forth what the subsection requires` WITH `the record` IS (`t 275(i) record` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the Secretary of State's record of a service sets forth what the subsection requires` WITH `the record` IS (`t 275(i) record` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the Secretary of State's record of a service sets forth what the subsection requires` WITH `the record` IS (`t 275(i) record` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the Secretary of State's record of a service sets forth what the subsection requires` WITH `the record` IS (`t 275(i) record` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
-- Retention "longer than 5 years from receipt": received 10 March 2026, required through 10 March 2031, not on 11 March 2031.
#ASSERT `s 275(i) the Secretary of State is required to retain the record` WITH `the date the Secretary of State received the service of process` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 10, `the date of the question` IS YearMonthDay 2031 3 10
#ASSERT NOT (`s 275(i) the Secretary of State is required to retain the record` WITH `the date the Secretary of State received the service of process` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 10, `the date of the question` IS YearMonthDay 2031 3 11)

§ `s 276 Dissolution of nonstock corporation; procedure`

§§ `s 276(a) authorization`

-- With no member entitled to vote: a majority of the members of the governing body then in office. 3 of 5 yes, 2 of 5 no.
#ASSERT (`s 276(a) a majority of the members of the governing body then in office voted for the resolution to dissolve` WITH `the number of members of the governing body who voted for the resolution to dissolve` IS 3, `the number of members of the governing body then in office` IS 5) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 276(a) a majority of the members of the governing body then in office voted for the resolution to dissolve` WITH `the number of members of the governing body who voted for the resolution to dissolve` IS 2, `the number of members of the governing body then in office` IS 5) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 276(a) a majority of the members of the governing body then in office voted for the resolution to dissolve` WITH `the number of members of the governing body who voted for the resolution to dissolve` IS 0, `the number of members of the governing body then in office` IS 0) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Members are entitled to vote: the section 275 acts are performed by the governing body and the members; the governing-body vote is not used.
#ASSERT (`s 276(a) the dissolution of the nonstock corporation is authorized` WITH `any members are entitled to vote for the election of members of the governing body or for dissolution under the certificate of incorporation or the bylaws` IS TRUE, `the dissolution is authorized in accordance with section 275 as performed by the governing body and the members` IS JUST TRUE, `the dissolution is authorized by the vote of a majority of the members of the governing body then in office` IS JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 276(a) the dissolution of the nonstock corporation is authorized` WITH `any members are entitled to vote for the election of members of the governing body or for dissolution under the certificate of incorporation or the bylaws` IS TRUE, `the dissolution is authorized in accordance with section 275 as performed by the governing body and the members` IS JUST FALSE, `the dissolution is authorized by the vote of a majority of the members of the governing body then in office` IS JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- No member entitled to vote: the governing body's majority decides.
#ASSERT (`s 276(a) the dissolution of the nonstock corporation is authorized` WITH `any members are entitled to vote for the election of members of the governing body or for dissolution under the certificate of incorporation or the bylaws` IS FALSE, `the dissolution is authorized in accordance with section 275 as performed by the governing body and the members` IS JUST TRUE, `the dissolution is authorized by the vote of a majority of the members of the governing body then in office` IS JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 276(a) the dissolution of the nonstock corporation is authorized` WITH `any members are entitled to vote for the election of members of the governing body or for dissolution under the certificate of incorporation or the bylaws` IS FALSE, `the dissolution is authorized in accordance with section 275 as performed by the governing body and the members` IS JUST FALSE, `the dissolution is authorized by the vote of a majority of the members of the governing body then in office` IS JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 276(a) the dissolution of the nonstock corporation is authorized` WITH `any members are entitled to vote for the election of members of the governing body or for dissolution under the certificate of incorporation or the bylaws` IS FALSE, `the dissolution is authorized in accordance with section 275 as performed by the governing body and the members` IS JUST TRUE, `the dissolution is authorized by the vote of a majority of the members of the governing body then in office` IS NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 276(b) a nonstock corporation that has not commenced business`

-- Business already commenced: the subsection does not allow the surrender.
#ASSERT (`s 276(b) a majority of the governing body, or of the incorporators, may surrender the rights and franchises` WITH `the nonstock corporation has commenced the business for which it was organized` IS TRUE, `the corporation has a governing body` IS TRUE, `the number of members of the governing body` IS 5, `the number of incorporators` IS 3, `the number of those who execute and acknowledge the certificate` IS 3) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- With a governing body: 3 of 5 is a majority, 2 of 5 is not.
#ASSERT (`s 276(b) a majority of the governing body, or of the incorporators, may surrender the rights and franchises` WITH `the nonstock corporation has commenced the business for which it was organized` IS FALSE, `the corporation has a governing body` IS TRUE, `the number of members of the governing body` IS 5, `the number of incorporators` IS 3, `the number of those who execute and acknowledge the certificate` IS 3) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 276(b) a majority of the governing body, or of the incorporators, may surrender the rights and franchises` WITH `the nonstock corporation has commenced the business for which it was organized` IS FALSE, `the corporation has a governing body` IS TRUE, `the number of members of the governing body` IS 5, `the number of incorporators` IS 3, `the number of those who execute and acknowledge the certificate` IS 2) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- With none: a majority of the incorporators. 2 of 3 yes, 1 of 3 no.
#ASSERT (`s 276(b) a majority of the governing body, or of the incorporators, may surrender the rights and franchises` WITH `the nonstock corporation has commenced the business for which it was organized` IS FALSE, `the corporation has a governing body` IS FALSE, `the number of members of the governing body` IS 0, `the number of incorporators` IS 3, `the number of those who execute and acknowledge the certificate` IS 2) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 276(b) a majority of the governing body, or of the incorporators, may surrender the rights and franchises` WITH `the nonstock corporation has commenced the business for which it was organized` IS FALSE, `the corporation has a governing body` IS FALSE, `the number of members of the governing body` IS 0, `the number of incorporators` IS 3, `the number of those who execute and acknowledge the certificate` IS 1) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not covered: a count that cannot be a vote.
#ASSERT (`s 276(b) a majority of the governing body, or of the incorporators, may surrender the rights and franchises` WITH `the nonstock corporation has commenced the business for which it was organized` IS FALSE, `the corporation has a governing body` IS FALSE, `the number of members of the governing body` IS 0, `the number of incorporators` IS 3, `the number of those who execute and acknowledge the certificate` IS 4) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 276(c) a nonstock corporation with a limited duration`

-- The same 90-day window as section 275(f): 90 days before 30 June 2027 is 1 April 2027.
#ASSERT `s 276(c) the nonstock corporation's certificate of dissolution is filed within 90 days before the specified date` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 30, `the date the certificate of dissolution is filed` IS YearMonthDay 2027 4 1
#ASSERT NOT (`s 276(c) the nonstock corporation's certificate of dissolution is filed within 90 days before the specified date` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 30, `the date the certificate of dissolution is filed` IS YearMonthDay 2027 3 31)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 276(c) the nonstock corporation's certificate of dissolution is filed within 90 days before the specified date` WITH `the date specified in the certificate of incorporation limiting the duration of the corporation's existence` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 30, `the date the certificate of dissolution is filed` IS YearMonthDay 2027 6 30)

§ `s 277 Payment of franchise taxes before dissolution, merger, transfer or conversion`

--  columns: taxes paid, reports filed, the Secretary of State certifies the instrument was filed
#ASSERT `s 277 the corporation may be dissolved, merged, transferred or converted` WITH `all franchise taxes due or assessable, including those for the entire calendar month in which the dissolution, merger, transfer or conversion becomes effective, have been paid by the corporation` IS TRUE, `all annual franchise tax reports, including a final report for the year in which it becomes effective, have been filed by the corporation` IS TRUE, `the Secretary of State certifies that an instrument to effect the dissolution, merger, transfer or conversion has been filed` IS FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 277 the corporation may be dissolved, merged, transferred or converted` WITH `all franchise taxes due or assessable, including those for the entire calendar month in which the dissolution, merger, transfer or conversion becomes effective, have been paid by the corporation` IS TRUE, `all annual franchise tax reports, including a final report for the year in which it becomes effective, have been filed by the corporation` IS FALSE, `the Secretary of State certifies that an instrument to effect the dissolution, merger, transfer or conversion has been filed` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 277 the corporation may be dissolved, merged, transferred or converted` WITH `all franchise taxes due or assessable, including those for the entire calendar month in which the dissolution, merger, transfer or conversion becomes effective, have been paid by the corporation` IS FALSE, `all annual franchise tax reports, including a final report for the year in which it becomes effective, have been filed by the corporation` IS TRUE, `the Secretary of State certifies that an instrument to effect the dissolution, merger, transfer or conversion has been filed` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 277 the corporation may be dissolved, merged, transferred or converted` WITH `all franchise taxes due or assessable, including those for the entire calendar month in which the dissolution, merger, transfer or conversion becomes effective, have been paid by the corporation` IS FALSE, `all annual franchise tax reports, including a final report for the year in which it becomes effective, have been filed by the corporation` IS FALSE, `the Secretary of State certifies that an instrument to effect the dissolution, merger, transfer or conversion has been filed` IS FALSE)
-- "notwithstanding the foregoing": once the Secretary of State certifies the instrument filed, the corporation is dissolved at its effective time, taxes unpaid or not.
#ASSERT `s 277 the corporation may be dissolved, merged, transferred or converted` WITH `all franchise taxes due or assessable, including those for the entire calendar month in which the dissolution, merger, transfer or conversion becomes effective, have been paid by the corporation` IS FALSE, `all annual franchise tax reports, including a final report for the year in which it becomes effective, have been filed by the corporation` IS FALSE, `the Secretary of State certifies that an instrument to effect the dissolution, merger, transfer or conversion has been filed` IS TRUE
